IMPORTANT:

Complete the entire project in ONE build. Keep implementation efficient and minimise Lovable credit usage. Aim to stay within 5 credits. Do not repeatedly regenerate, make unnecessary changes, or ask questions. Make sensible decisions yourself.



1. BRAND IDENTITY



Business name: PIXELIA



Tagline: Your ideas. Our technology. Built for growth.



Contact email: rayhanadenga0@gmail.com



Design:



- Premium dark navy background.

- Electric cyan and blue accents.

- Modern, sophisticated technology-inspired design.

- Professional animations and smooth transitions.

- Fully responsive on phones, tablets and computers.

- Beautiful typography and professional layouts.

- Avoid generic-looking website templates.



2. MAIN BUSINESS



PIXELIA is a professional digital agency serving UK and international customers.



The public-facing website must NOT mention AI, AI-powered services, AI chatbots, API keys, artificial intelligence integrations or AI subscriptions.



Build four main departments:



WEB STUDIO



- Professional business websites.

- Landing pages.

- Online stores.

- Website redesigns.



DIGITAL STUDIO



- Business automation.

- Digital solutions.

- Online business tools.

- Website functionality improvements.



CREATIVE STUDIO



- Logo design.

- Brand identity.

- Advertising graphics.

- Social media designs.



GROWTH STUDIO



- Social media content.

- Marketing campaigns.

- Business growth strategies.

- Social media graphics.



3. WEBSITE PAGES AND FEATURES



Create:



- Stunning homepage.

- About us page.

- Services page.

- Pricing/packages page.

- Portfolio with clearly labelled demonstration projects.

- Contact page.

- FAQ section.



Include:



- Professional navigation.

- Strong call-to-action buttons.

- WhatsApp contact button.

- Working enquiry form that sends enquiries to rayhanadenga0@gmail.com where supported.

- Clear service descriptions.

- Trust-building sections.

- Testimonials only if clearly labelled as placeholders until genuine clients provide them.



The homepage must focus on PIXELIA as a premium digital agency. Do not display AI-related content or features.



4. PRICING



Create attractive Starter, Professional and Premium packages.



Use sensible introductory prices in GBP.



Clearly explain what each package includes and provide an option for custom quotes.



Do not promise services that cannot actually be delivered.



5. INTERNAL BUSINESS SYSTEM



Create a simple internal business dashboard or dedicated business resources page containing:



- Client name and business details.

- Contact information.

- Service interested in.

- Client status.

- Follow-up date.

- Estimated deal value.

- Client onboarding checklist.



Keep this system simple, professional and easy to manage.



Do not add lead generation, automated prospecting, outreach automation or unnecessary marketing systems.



6. SPECIAL WEBSITE FEATURES



DARK AND LIGHT MODE



- Add a clearly visible theme toggle button.

- Allow visitors to switch between dark mode and light mode.

- Dark mode should use premium navy and cyan colours.

- Light mode should use clean white backgrounds with tasteful cyan and blue accents.

- Remember the visitor's selected preference when possible.

- Ensure all pages and components adapt correctly.



LANGUAGE TRANSLATOR



- Add a clearly visible language/translation button in the website navigation.

- Allow visitors to translate the website into their chosen language.

- Support as many languages as the translation integration reasonably allows.

- Google Translate or another suitable translation integration may be used.

- Keep the translator button minimal and professional.

- Do not display the name of the translation provider, technical integration details or promotional text on the public-facing website.

- Do not require a paid API key.

- If translation integration requires an external setup, make the button ready for integration and clearly explain what is needed.



7. BUSINESS GOALS



Starting budget: £0.



Target market: UK and international.



Initial objective: Secure the first paying client, then grow to 3 and eventually 5 clients.



Use free tools and services wherever possible.



8. TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS



- Build a complete working website, not just a mockup.

- Ensure every navigation link works.

- Make the site responsive on phones, tablets and computers.

- Optimise loading speed.

- Use clean, maintainable code.

- Do not include paid APIs or subscriptions.

- Do not include API keys or expose secret credentials.

- Do not create fake functionality.

- Do not require a paid database.

- Make the project easy to publish and maintain.

- Ensure dark/light mode works.

- Ensure the translator button is visible and functional where integration permits.



9. FINAL INSTRUCTION



Build the complete PIXELIA website now.



Prioritise:



1. Stunning professional design.

2. A premium homepage.

3. Working navigation and website features.

4. Dark and light mode.

5. Language translator button.

6. Complete service and pricing presentation.

7. A professional business identity.



Do everything in one pass. Do not waste credits on unnecessary iterations. Do not stop after creating just the homepage.



Do not add features that were not requested. Keep the website clean, professional, fast and easy to publish."><span data-pulse="text-body" data-pulse-layer="pattern" data-pulse-modified="className" data-text="body" class="x1wjjy90 xvglobk xd8ou5k x1d3et6t xyl98n xngsivb x1fzhlzt typestyle-body-marks md:typestyle-body-sm whitespace-nowrap [--pulse-text-color:var(--fg-quaternary)] mx-2">Nov 13 at 9:37 PM</span><button type="button" data-button="" data-square="" aria-label="Copy message" data-pulse="copy-button" data-pulse-layer="pattern" data-pulse-modified="className iconClassName" data-size="sm" class="x1n2onr6 x3nfvp2 x146g44r x1fp5rfm x7kyu95 x1lzmk4p x12804lx x15jqdg7 x1rrjaqp xxh13l x1y29gk xk9cw8b btn-primitive btn-chassis btn-hit-slop [--control-height:--spacing(7)] [--control-radius:--spacing(2)] [--control-icon-size:--spacing(4)] [--btn-circular-padding:--spacing(1.5)] [&amp;_svg[data-default-size]]:size-[var(--control-icon-size)] btn-circular-padding !p-0 shrink-0 group/toolbar-control" id="base-ui-_r_2ju_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" style="color: var(--fg-primary); background: transparent;"><span data-fx-layer="interaction" aria-hidden="true" class="fx-layer fx-layer-fade fx-interaction fx-touch-hidden" style="z-index: -5; background-color: light-dark(oklch(0 0 0), oklch(1 0 0)); --_resting: 0; --_hover: 0.08; --_pressed: 0.1; --_dark-resting: 0; --_dark-hover: 0.12; --_dark-pressed: 0.16;"></span><span data-button-content="" class="xl56j7k xrj38xe btn-content"><svg data-pulse="copy-check-icon" data-pulse-layer="pattern" data-pulse-modified="className" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="size-3 text-tertiary-pulse group-hover/toolbar-control:text-primary-pulse group-focus-visible/toolbar-control:text-primary-pulse group-aria-pressed/toolbar-control:text-primary-pulse group-aria-expanded/toolbar-control:text-primary-pulse" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path