I've built the full PIXELIA website. I checked every page in a test browser, and they all load with no errors and look right on computers and phones.

What's on the site:
- Pages: Home, Services, Pricing, Portfolio, About, FAQ and Contact, all reachable from the menu, which collapses into a tap-to-open menu on phones. Nothing mentions AI anywhere.
- The four studios (Web, Digital, Creative, Growth), each with its services and a &quot;from&quot; price where one makes sense.
- Packages: Starter £249, Professional £549 (marked &quot;Most popular&quot;) and Premium £999, plus prices for single services and a custom-quote option. Clicking a package opens the contact form with that package already chosen.
- Portfolio: four example projects, each clearly labelled as a demonstration project. Testimonials are clearly labelled as placeholders.
- Dark and light mode: the sun/moon button switches between them, and the site remembers the visitor's choice.
- Language button: the globe button offers over 100 languages with a search box. I tested it in French and the page translated. No provider name appears anywhere.
- Client Hub: an internal page at `/dashboard`, not linked from the menu and hidden from search engines. It holds the client details you listed plus a 10-step onboarding checklist, and it counts paying clients against your goals of 1, 3 and 5. I tested adding a client, and it was still there after reloading. It saves only in the browser you use, so download a backup now and then with the Export button.

Two things you need to do:
1. Turn on the enquiry form. It uses FormSubmit, a free email service, to send enquiries to rayhanadenga0@gmail.com. I sent one test enquiry, which made FormSubmit email you an &quot;Activate Form&quot; link. Click it once and enquiries will start arriving. Until then, visitors who submit see a message asking them to email you directly.
2. Send me your WhatsApp number, with the country code (for example 447700900123). The green WhatsApp button is showing, but for now it opens the contact page. Once I have your number it will open a WhatsApp chat with you.

