IMPORTANT:

Build this efficiently in one pass. Reuse the existing website design and components wherever possible. Minimise Lovable credit usage. Do not redesign the public website or add unnecessary features.



1. ADMIN LOGIN



Create a private admin login at /admin.



- Secure email and password authentication.

- Only authorised administrators can access it.

- No public registration.

- Add logout functionality.

- Protect all admin routes.

- Never store passwords or secret keys in frontend code.

- Use proper authentication and database security rules.



2. ADMIN DASHBOARD



Create a premium dashboard matching PIXELIA's branding.



Display:



- Total clients.

- Active projects.

- New enquiries.

- Completed projects.

- Total recorded revenue.



Use attractive statistic cards and a clean layout.



3. CLIENT MANAGEMENT



Allow the administrator to:



- Add clients.

- Edit client details.

- Delete clients.

- View client contact information.

- Record services purchased.

- Record project prices.

- Update project status.



4. ENQUIRIES



Create an enquiries management section.



- View enquiries submitted through the public website.

- View customer names, emails and messages.

- Mark enquiries as new, contacted or converted.

- Delete enquiries.

- Keep enquiries private.



5. PROJECT MANAGEMENT



Allow the administrator to:



- Create projects.

- Assign projects to clients.

- Add project descriptions.

- Set project prices.

- Update progress.

- Mark projects as completed.



6. DESIGN



- Dark navy and electric cyan theme.

- Professional sidebar navigation.

- Clean dashboard cards.

- Responsive on mobile, tablet and desktop.

- Include dark/light mode support.

- Smooth transitions.

- Easy-to-use interface.



7. TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS



- Use secure authentication.

- Persist data using a suitable free database option.

- Protect customer information.

- Enforce database permissions so unauthorised users cannot access or modify records.

- Do not expose API keys or credentials.

- Do not introduce paid subscriptions.

- Reuse existing project infrastructure wherever possible.

- Do not break existing PIXELIA website functionality.



FINAL INSTRUCTION



Build the complete working PIXELIA admin dashboard in one pass.



Do not add lead generation, automated outreach, AI features, unnecessary analytics or extra marketing tools.



Keep it simple, secure, professional and functional."><span data-pulse="text-body" data-pulse-layer="pattern" data-pulse-modified="className" data-text="body" class="x1wjjy90 xvglobk xd8ou5k x1d3et6t xyl98n xngsivb x1fzhlzt typestyle-body-marks md:typestyle-body-sm whitespace-nowrap [--pulse-text-color:var(--fg-quaternary)] mx-2">Yesterday at 8:37 AM</span><button type="button" data-button="" data-square="" aria-label="Copy message" data-pulse="copy-button" data-pulse-layer="pattern" data-pulse-modified="className iconClassName" data-size="sm" class="x1n2onr6 x3nfvp2 x146g44r x1fp5rfm x7kyu95 x1lzmk4p x12804lx x15jqdg7 x1rrjaqp xxh13l x1y29gk xk9cw8b btn-primitive btn-chassis btn-hit-slop [--control-height:--spacing(7)] [--control-radius:--spacing(2)] [--control-icon-size:--spacing(4)] [--btn-circular-padding:--spacing(1.5)] [&amp;_svg[data-default-size]]:size-[var(--control-icon-size)] btn-circular-padding !p-0 shrink-0 group/toolbar-control" id="base-ui-_r_2nn_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" style="color: var(--fg-primary); background: transparent;"><span data-fx-layer="interaction" aria-hidden="true" class="fx-layer fx-layer-fade fx-interaction fx-touch-hidden" style="z-index: -5; background-color: light-dark(oklch(0 0 0), oklch(1 0 0)); --_resting: 0; --_hover: 0.08; --_pressed: 0.1; --_dark-resting: 0; --_dark-hover: 0.12; --_dark-pressed: 0.16;"></span><span data-button-content="" class="xl56j7k xrj38xe btn-content"><svg data-pulse="copy-check-icon" data-pulse-layer="pattern" data-pulse-modified="className" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="size-3 text-tertiary-pulse group-hover/toolbar-control:text-primary-pulse group-focus-visible/toolbar-control:text-primary-pulse group-aria-pressed/toolbar-control:text-primary-pulse group-aria-expanded/toolbar-control:text-primary-pulse" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path class="motion-reduce:transition-none!" d="M19 15h1a2