 left in your balance under the credit bar (click your workspace name at the top of the sidebar).</p>
<p dir="ltr">What's actually still open is small:</p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li><strong>Check the admin area works</strong><span> — sign in at /admin, confirm the dashboard numbers, clients, projects and enquiries all load and save.</span></li>
<li><strong>Retire the old Client Hub</strong><span> at /dashboard so it points to the new admin area instead of keeping a separate copy of your data.</span></li>
<li><strong>A quick figures check</strong><span> so the revenue and project counts stay correct as you add records.</span></li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">Two things only you can do, both free:</p>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li>Click the "Activate Form" link in the email from FormSubmit so enquiries arrive by email.</li>
<li>Send me your WhatsApp number with country code so the green button opens a chat with you.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="ltr">Say "continue" and I'll do 1–3 in one pass, then tell you what I found.</p></div><div tabindex="-1" class="not-prose my-4 whitespace-normal outline-none [&amp;_h3]:m-0 [&amp;_p]:m-0"><div class="w-full" data-pulse="card" data-pulse-layer="pattern" data-pulse-modified="slotDrawer header.slotOverline"><div data-pulse="card-drawer" data-pulse-layer="styled-primitive" class="x1pjcqnp xlk9m6x xfqu2nr xuyelkn x1q649ln xvrro4i xpkd4ep rounded-6 mb-2 flex w-full flex-col"><div data-pulse="card-surface" data-pulse-layer="styled-primitive" class="x1pjcqnp xa0u2ev x7hk04m xeo5q6c x1e8ypvl x12ee1rr xpkd4ep rounded-6 flex flex-col"><div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 p-4"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2"><div data-pulse="card-intro" data-pulse-layer="styled-primitive" data-pulse-modified="slotOverline" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><div class="relative"><div><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span data-pulse="text-body" data-pulse-layer="pattern" data-text="body" data-text-contrast="normal" class="xb25hht x1u6kqjq x1rfwx2w x1vv2aly x30y34q xorki00 x1bzf4m4 x1fzhlzt typestyle-body-marks">Goal for the app</span><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_r_2pt_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-pulse="infotip" data-pulse-layer="pattern" aria-describedby="_r_2pq_" aria-label="What Lovable thinks the goal is" class="focus-outline-pulse relative inline-flex shrink-0 rounded-full after:absolute after:-inset-1.5 pointer-coarse:after:-inset-3.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" class="x2lah0s x1ejlixx x1enn776 text-tertiary-pulse" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="" data-circular-artwork=""><path d="M13 7.5C13 6.94772 12.5523 6.5 12 6.5C11.4477 6.5 11 6.94772 11 7.5C11 8.05228 11.4477 8.5 12 8.5C12.5523 8.5 13 8.05228 13 7.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M20.25 12C20.25 7.44365 16.5563 3.75 12 3.75C7.44365 3.75 3.75 7.4