What's actually still open is small:

1. Check the admin area works — sign in at /admin, confirm the dashboard numbers, clients, projects and enquiries all load and save.
2. Retire the old Client Hub at /dashboard so it points to the new admin area instead of keeping a separate copy of your data.
3. A quick figures check so the revenue and project counts stay correct as you add records.

Two things only you can do, both free:

- Click the &quot;Activate Form&quot; link in the email from FormSubmit so enquiries arrive by email.
- Send me your WhatsApp number with country code so the green button opens a chat with you.

